  "description": "Optional Arabic-script language pack for NetPdf. Registers Arabic (ar), Persian/Farsi (fa), and Urdu (ur) with NetPdf's public HyphenationRegistry as explicit NO-hyphenation languages — Arabic-script text is not soft-hyphenated (justification uses kashida/tatweel elongation, not hyphens) — so hyphens:auto inserts no hyphens for those languages instead of falling back to the English hyphenator. Call ArabicHyphenation.Register at startup; a module initializer also drives it on assembly load.",
